{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>油塘發生墮海意外。今晚（22日）10時許，一名年約70歲老翁從油塘鯉魚門三家村碼頭樓梯意外墮海，途人見狀救人，老翁保持清醒，沒有受傷，在場接受檢查。</p><p>就現場所見，警員在場調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"老翁保持清醒，沒有受傷，在場接受檢查。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167978465429819392203856.jpeg/49qUI8uc7q4pExstEGx0kJwLsMFegZw5NxJbuA0SW7g\"/><figcaption>老翁保持清醒，沒有受傷，在場接受檢查。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167978469087383552689025.jpeg/czlis5eAK6bg7i3JA8FDVQdVf-fWPnEhyrH1d_Cx9Xc\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"圖為涉事樓梯。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167978475014197248248391.jpeg/2-Mketu2DnTS1pjaSr70ELZZSJ8_qmS24lON7NhTjew\"/><figcaption>圖為涉事樓梯。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護員到場。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167978472459735040532741.jpeg/oD--drr2ODDv2sx707OarHJKcTaT4QCN5voU4dz6FOE\"/><figcaption>救護員到場。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T15:56:57.161731+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}